TIMetaTemplate.displayName.WarForOurWorldScenario=1898 - War for our World
TIMetaTemplate.description.WarForOurWorldScenario=The aliens reach Earth in 1898. Colonial empires rule the planet, there is no spaceflight, no nuclear weapons and a world economy at two percent of its present size.<br/><h>No tutorial. Very high difficulty.</h>
TIMetaTemplate.displayName.WarForOurWorldMarsScenario=1898 - War for our World from Mars
TIMetaTemplate.description.WarForOurWorldMarsScenario=As the 1898 scenario, but the invaders come from Mars as in Wells.<br/><h>No tutorial. Very high difficulty.</h>
